+
+```sh
+curl http://localhost:8080/v1/quota -H 'X-Orch-Namespace: payments'
+curl -X PUT http://localhost:8080/v1/quota \
+  -H 'X-Orch-Namespace: payments' -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \
